	(text "J6: JST PH 8 to the bay's camera pod (Arducam Mega 3MP SPI + white LEDs), ≈ 50 cm"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.51 17.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a2d105cf-b91a-52e7-87d7-d6a0ad6db1f2")
	)
	(text_box "Lead pinout: 1 CAM_5V · 2 GND · 3 SCK · 4 GND · 5 MOSI · 6 MISO · 7 CS · 8 LED_K (the LEDs' cathode side).\nSPI2 through the GPIO matrix, mode 0, 4 MHz (2 MHz fallback): IO11 SCK, IO10 MOSI, IO9 MISO, IO8 CS (10k\n  pull-up: deselected before firmware), IO7 the light (R36 holds it off at boot; LEDC PWM ≥ 20 kHz or on/off).\nCAM_5V through F1 (0.5 A PTC): the camera ≈ 120 mA + the LEDs ≤ 150 mA.  USBLC6s on the lead side of the 33 Ω.\nThe camera pod board runs the Mega from 3.3 V (its own AMS1117): MISO is 3.3 V and R35 stays unpopulated.\n  For a camera fed 5 V that drives MISO at 5 V instead: R33 → 330 Ω and fit R35 (680 Ω): 3.37 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 162.56 0)
		(size 289.56 17.78)
		(margins 1.5 1.5 1.5 1.5)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
